WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.960
In May 1918, three Ottoman columns
pushed toward Yerevan.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.317
Behind the thin front were
hundreds of thousands of refugees
from the Genocide.

3
00:00:12.557 --> 00:00:15.606
General Movses Silikyan
gathered what he had.

4
00:00:15.846 --> 00:00:20.122
On 22 May, the Armenians
counterattacked beneath Ararat.

5
00:00:20.162 --> 00:00:22.772
The May battles stopped
the Ottoman drive,

6
00:00:22.812 --> 00:00:26.789
and on 28 May the First Republic
of Armenia was born.

7
00:00:27.029 --> 00:00:29.300
Not one step back.

